      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Schedule Trigger\n\n**WHAT IT DOES:**\n- Runs workflow automatically\n- Executes workflow at a specified time\n\n**CONFIGURATION:**\n- Currently: Every 5 minutes\n- Node is disabled until activated\n\n**HOW TO USE:**\n1. Enable this node (select all nodes in the workflow and press D)\n2. SAVE workflow (Ctrl+S)\n3. ACTIVATE workflow (toggle at top)\n4. Wait 1 minute\n5. Check Executions tab\n\n**IMPORTANT:**\n- Must SAVE before activating\n- Must ACTIVATE for schedule to work\n- Check your [timezone settings](https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/core-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.scheduletrigger)\n\n**USE CASES:**\n- Scheduled hourly market data collection\n- Daily EOD report generation\n- Sending automated reminders for missing invoices.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
